    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d529">

                <pb facs="0712" n="426" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg426"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72112/2743</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Norwegian Minister</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bryn</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-08-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 1, 1916</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Minister</hi>: Please accept my most
                    sincere apologies for the delay in answering your letter of July 22.<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d529-f1"/> Through some very stupid mistake, it was sent to
                    the wrong bureau and did not reach me until to-day. I took the matter of the
                    delay up at once and I feel sure it will not occur again.</p>
                <pb facs="0713" n="427" xml:id="pg427"/>
                <p>The information that you sought was in regard to the black list, and you probably
                    have now learned from the newspapers all the details you need. However, I
                    enclose for your information a copy of the note sent to Great Britain. I will
                    give instructions that you are to be kept informed regarding any further action
                    taken by us in this connection.</p>
                <p>Believe me [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frank L. Polk</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
